# ZvenFit frontend files

## HTML (Webflow export)

- Class names are Webflow-generated — preserve them unless refactoring CSS too
- Duplicated footer: `section-4` (desktop) + `section-3` (mobile) — prefer snippet/markers over N-file edits
- Keep marker comments intact: `<!-- ZvenFit: ... -->`

## CSS

- Source: `public/css/zvenfit.webflow.css`
- Build produces minified copy — edit source file only
- a11y backlog in `TODO.md` Critical: focus states, contrast, touch targets, reduced motion

## JS

- No bundler — plain browser JS with `window.*` config globals
- `lead-config.js` / `schedule-config.js` contain placeholders replaced at build — don't hardcode prod URLs

## Scope

Minimize diff. One page change ≠ refactor all 26 HTML files unless explicitly requested.
